API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5675484Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5676224Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5676442Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5676805Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5677440Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5677714Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5677888Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5678275Z    if you are ready to continue.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5678619Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5679445Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5680355Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5681056Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5681649Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5682399Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5682711Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5683170Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5683508Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5684258Z    can use Nix.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5684505Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5684672Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-08T18:04:37.5684945Z 
